  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-30T23:50:40.431Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Feature of Loading Texture for Avatar from URL\n\nHi,\n\nI would like to have the Dynamic Image function for the texture image applied by Avater. However, we believe that the images that can be loaded with this function may be limited to images registered in the gallery of the player on the VRChat website. By selecting an image uploaded to the gallery from the control panel in VRChat, the player will switch the image and the texture image.\n\nThe avatar can hold a board in its hand and apply this function to it, making it possible to make various presentations using images.",
